<title>USA: Lithia sees Q4 EPS between $0.10-$0.11.</title>
<headline>Lithia sees Q4 EPS between $0.10-$0.11.</headline>
<dateline>MEDFORD, Ore 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithia Motors Inc on Wednesday said it expected fourth-quarter earnings to be between $0.10 and $0.11 per share on a First-In-First out basis, exceeding analyst estimates by 10-20 percent.</p>
</text>
